1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,420
My client just texted, why is the site so slow?

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,420
If she doesn't pay, I don't make rent.

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,200
Did you build it or did the AI?

4
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:07,580
We collaborated.

5
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,360
Run page speed on her homepage.

6
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,240
Read the warnings, not just the score.

7
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,320
It says reduce unused JavaScript.

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:14,980
How many plugins did you install?

9
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,480
Whatever the AI asked for.

10
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:18,400
Remove every plugin you can't explain.

11
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,240
And you load six font weights.

12
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:21,060
Use two.

13
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:22,580
But the thin one is so pretty.

14
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:23,740
Nobody sees it.

15
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:24,860
It hasn't loaded yet.

16
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,640
Then cache your images and scripts.

17
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,100
So visitors download them once.

18
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,200
So she pays me tonight?

19
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,480
Be honest with her. Half the slowness was plugins you never needed.

20
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:33,440
Can I blame the AI?

21
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,580
You can try. It didn't send her an invoice.

22
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,200
Comment the word fast. I'll send you the checklist.

